# === Per-clinic provisioning (packaging/provision_clinic.py) ===
# vendor ledger of issued licenses, encrypted weights, model bundles dropped
# into the app's inbox, and any license.dat (it carries the clinic's
# model_key_secret) must never reach the public repo
data/licenses/
data/model_inbox/
model_inbox/
*.enc
license.dat
